    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/1b0ddb8e06b216bdc172623ecc27629d.avif?t=1736842022\" /></div><br><br>Design your home and your shop exactly to your liking. Place furniture, decorate walls and ceilings,<br>or simply change the wallpaper and flooring. <br>Create a unique atmosphere that delights both you and your customers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/93111114ae73ef163c17b65f82a168a3.poster.avif?t=1736842022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/93111114ae73ef163c17b65f82a168a3.webm?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/93111114ae73ef163c17b65f82a168a3.mp4?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/e355b6dff7bb9021565d74ee96ff17ab.avif?t=1736842022\" /></div><br><br>In Aeonica, there are many interesting potential partners.<br>Go on dates, deepen your relationships, and experience a romantic story that can lead to marriage and beyond.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/b39a70fc39d48f200c6af51712e3d697.poster.avif?t=1736842022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/b39a70fc39d48f200c6af51712e3d697.webm?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/b39a70fc39d48f200c6af51712e3d697.mp4?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/c1386947550124f005b9759a34a7c886.avif?t=1736842022\" /></div><br><br>Whether it's fresh produce, handcrafted creations, or rare fish \u2013 decide what to sell and how your shop looks.<br>Take care of your spirit customers and make sure they keep coming back.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/d92257bbdbf0508ecb5ac515c20f694c.poster.avif?t=1736842022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/d92257bbdbf0508ecb5ac515c20f694c.webm?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/d92257bbdbf0508ecb5ac515c20f694c.mp4?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/578aab66d6c31cb4e77757fabe87fe55.avif?t=1736842022\" /></div><br><br>Plant crops, raise animals, build pathways, and decorate your farm.<br>Create your own little paradise and supply your shop with fresh products.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/ff74d0b7dfad54265b2374f20af1633c.poster.avif?t=1736842022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/ff74d0b7dfad54265b2374f20af1633c.webm?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/ff74d0b7dfad54265b2374f20af1633c.mp4?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/1b0ddb8e06b216bdc172623ecc27629d.avif?t=1736842022\" /></div><br><br>Design your home and your shop exactly to your liking. Place furniture, decorate walls and ceilings,<br>or simply change the wallpaper and flooring. <br>Create a unique atmosphere that delights both you and your customers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/93111114ae73ef163c17b65f82a168a3.poster.avif?t=1736842022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/93111114ae73ef163c17b65f82a168a3.webm?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/93111114ae73ef163c17b65f82a168a3.mp4?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/e355b6dff7bb9021565d74ee96ff17ab.avif?t=1736842022\" /></div><br><br>In Aeonica, there are many interesting potential partners.<br>Go on dates, deepen your relationships, and experience a romantic story that can lead to marriage and beyond.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/b39a70fc39d48f200c6af51712e3d697.poster.avif?t=1736842022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/b39a70fc39d48f200c6af51712e3d697.webm?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/b39a70fc39d48f200c6af51712e3d697.mp4?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/c1386947550124f005b9759a34a7c886.avif?t=1736842022\" /></div><br><br>Whether it's fresh produce, handcrafted creations, or rare fish \u2013 decide what to sell and how your shop looks.<br>Take care of your spirit customers and make sure they keep coming back.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/d92257bbdbf0508ecb5ac515c20f694c.poster.avif?t=1736842022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/d92257bbdbf0508ecb5ac515c20f694c.webm?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/d92257bbdbf0508ecb5ac515c20f694c.mp4?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/578aab66d6c31cb4e77757fabe87fe55.avif?t=1736842022\" /></div><br><br>Plant crops, raise animals, build pathways, and decorate your farm.<br>Create your own little paradise and supply your shop with fresh products.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/ff74d0b7dfad54265b2374f20af1633c.poster.avif?t=1736842022\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/ff74d0b7dfad54265b2374f20af1633c.webm?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792780/extras/ff74d0b7dfad54265b2374f20af1633c.mp4?t=1736842022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "I built Spirit Vendor as a solo indie dev, and I'm excited to share it with you! In this charming world, you decide how your day unfolds\u2014run your shop, tend your fields, and care for your animals. Explore a lively village, meet unique characters, build friendships, and perhaps even find true love.",
